        <mxCell id="hdr" value="&lt;b&gt;PDM — Mô hình dữ liệu vật lý (SQL Server, EF Core)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px;color:#333&quot;&gt;Bảng = tên thực &lt;b&gt;Users, Tenants, …&lt;/b&gt;; &lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;pk&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt; / &lt;b&gt;&amp;lt;fk&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;; kiểu theo migration. Mũi tên hướng bảng &lt;i&gt;con&lt;/i&gt; (chứa FK). &lt;b&gt;Users ↔ Tenants&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;i&gt;1 — 0..1&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;code&gt;UserId&lt;/code&gt; unique). &lt;b&gt;OtpCodes&lt;/b&gt;: không FK tới Users.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="920" height="58" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

