        <mxCell id="leg" value="&lt;b&gt;Ghi chú PDM&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• Tên bảng / cột / kiểu lấy từ &lt;i&gt;ApplicationDbContextModelSnapshot&lt;/i&gt; (EF Core 9, SQL Server).&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Utilities&lt;/b&gt; = entity C# &lt;code&gt;UtilityReading&lt;/code&gt;, bảng &lt;code&gt;Utilities&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;• Cascade delete: Contracts←Room/Tenant, Invoices←Contract, Payments←Invoice, Utilities←Room, Tenants←User.&lt;br/&gt;• So sánh CDM / ERD: &lt;b&gt;BaoCao-CDM-MoiKetHop.drawio&lt;/b&gt;, &lt;b&gt;BaoCao-ERD-MoiKetHop.drawio&lt;/b&gt;." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#fffef0;strokeColor=#000000;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
